entries[374490] = { ["name"] = "Idol of the Dreamer", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 3\nTools: Jeweler's Tools\nReagents:\nAiry Soul , Ysemerald , Illimited Diamond , Glossy Stone (10), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nPolishing Cloth (#182) , Illustrious Insight (#93) , Infuse with Power (#111)\nVendor:\nMurik\nZone:\nThe Azure Span\nCost:\n400\n\nVendor:\nRokkutuk\nZone:\nThe Azure Span\nCost:\n400\n\nIdol of the Dreamer\nBinds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped: Idol of the Aspects (1)Trinket\n+244 [Agility or Strength or Intellect] Equip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to grant 34 Haste per Ysemerald you have equipped. Upon reaching 18 stacks, all stacks are consumed and you gain 573 secondary stats, split evenly for 15 sec.\n\"Whatever comes, I know you will face it with courage.\"" }
