entries[374493] = { ["name"] = "Idol of the Earth-Warder", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 3\nTools: Jeweler's Tools\nReagents:\nEarthen Soul , Neltharite , Illimited Diamond , Glossy Stone (10), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nPolishing Cloth (#182) , Illustrious Insight (#93) , Infuse with Power (#111)\nVendor:\nBoss Magor\nZone:\nThe Waking Shores\nDragonscale Expedition - Renown 13\nCost:\n200\n\nVendor:\nCataloger Jakes\nZone:\nThe Waking Shores\nDragonscale Expedition - Renown 13\nCost:\n200\n\nIdol of the Earth-Warder\nBinds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped: Idol of the Aspects (1)Trinket\n+244 [Agility or Strength or Intellect] Equip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to grant 34 Mastery per Neltharite you have equipped. Upon reaching 18 stacks, all stacks are consumed and you gain 573 secondary stats, split evenly for 15 sec.\n\"It is done. All have given that which must be given. I now seal the Dragon Soul forever.\"" }
