entries[374499] = { ["name"] = "Elemental Lariat", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 3\nTools: Jeweler's Tools\nReagents:\nShimmering Clasp (2), Illimited Diamond , Elemental Harmony , Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nDrop:\nPowerful Creatures within Primal Storms\nRecipe:\nPurchasable on the Auction House\n\nElemental Lariat\nBinds when picked up\nNeck\n+234 Stamina\n+ 360 Random Stat 1\n+ 360 Random Stat 2\nEquip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to empower one of your socketed elemental gems, granting 313 of their associated stat. Lasts 5 sec and an additional 1 sec per elemental gem." }
