entries[375142] = { ["name"] = "Slimy Expulsion Boots", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 3\nReagents:\nSalamanther Scales (10), Resilient Leather (150), Stonecrust Hide (18), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nThis putrid recipe requires an altar infused with powerful decay magic, rumored to be deep in Brackenhide Hollow.\nDrop:\nDecayed Creatures\nZone:\nBrackenhide Hollow and Surroundings\nRecipe:\nPurchasable on the Auction House\n\nSlimy Expulsion Boots\nBinds when picked up\nFeet Leather\n235 Armor\n+193 [Agility or Intellect]+312 Stamina\n+ 128 Versatility\n+ 205 Mastery\nDurability 80 / 80\nEquip: These boots ooze a toxic slime which slows your actions, reducing haste by 66 . Your attacks will occasionally splash slime onto your target, dealing 2674 Nature damage.\n\nThese effects are increased by 100% if you equip an item crafted with a Toxified Armor Patch.\n70" }
entries[375143] = { ["name"] = "Toxic Thorn Footwraps", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 3\nReagents:\nCacophonous Thunderscale (6), Resilient Leather (150), Frostbite Scales (18), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nThis putrid recipe requires an altar infused with powerful decay magic, rumored to be deep in Brackenhide Hollow.\nDrop:\nDecayed Creatures\nZone:\nBrackenhide Hollow and Surroundings\nRecipe:\nPurchasable on the Auction House\n\nToxic Thorn Footwraps\nBinds when picked up\nFeet Leather\n235 Armor\n+193 [Agility or Intellect]+312 Stamina\n+ 128 Critical Strike\n+ 205 Haste\nDurability 80 / 80\nEquip: The thorns feed off your vitality, reducing Stamina by 45 . Your spells and abilities have a chance to launch magical thorns at your target, healing allies for 4457 or striking enemies for 2674 Nature damage.\n\nThese effects are increased by 100% if you equip an item crafted with a Toxified Armor Patch.\n70" }
