entries[375199] = { ["name"] = "Witherrot Tome", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 3\nReagents:\nAwakened Decay (15), Tallstrider Sinew (2), Resilient Leather (100), Stonecrust Hide (14), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nInfuse with Power (#126) , Customize Secondary Stats (#227) , Illustrious Insight (#93)\nThis putrid recipe requires an altar infused with powerful decay magic, rumored to be deep in Brackenhide Hollow.\nSpecialization:\nPrimordial Leatherworking - Decaying Grasp\n\nWitherrot Tome\nBinds when picked up\nHeld In Off-hand\n+394 Intellect\n+208 Stamina\n+ 120 Random Stat 1\n+ 120 Random Stat 2\nEquip: Dealing damage with spells and abilities has a small chance to inflict a Tome-Wrought Rot upon your target, causing them to take 1780 Nature damage every 2 sec. and slowing their movement speed by 30% for 10 sec.\n70" }
